{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Catchick!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search and find!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The aim of this game is to get 9999C points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you do it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are various actions available to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here is an example:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375340/extras/56a3a49ab3f0b5ef8530b620ce17283b.avif?t=1748467746\" width=80 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are other actions with which you can get C points,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >for example, stand in front of a picture.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375340/extras/e82496a8df41b32b9aa7cc890525e698.avif?t=1748467746\" width=113 height=119 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful! Orange actions can hurt!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375340/extras/187e425973bdc67a9034a728ddbe8d28.avif?t=1748467746\" width=80 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the heart number drops to zero, it's game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to play Catchick? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the beginning of the game you have to entertain the brown-haired woman. Search and find her. When you have entertained her three times she will hide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375340/extras/46b428bcc598b806b1f84d719eda8134.avif?t=1748467746\" width=270 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide and seek: <br>after the &quot;Hide&quot; prompt appears, the goal is to find her. She is hiding somewhere near the colored containers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375340/extras/d5061cd39f105023899cb77dff2e6f33.avif?t=1748467746\" width=165 height=221 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find her, have fun with her three more times until she hides again. You get C points each time. If you have 9999 points, she hides one last time. Depending on how you played, you will then see one of the endings! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375340/extras/df76e71d225697920705c1a9631fd045.avif?t=1748467746\" width=623 height=366 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items can help you collect C points faster. Simply visit the item shop and buy an item. <br>But be careful, orange items hurt the woman. If the heart count drops to zero, the game is over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375340/extras/aa40d792d0ffb2fb1c7bed0e4d00af9e.avif?t=1748467746\" width=600 height=265 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can buy 1 item per hideout round. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here are other ways to get C points: <br>The woman in the shower (100C) <br>The woman in the toilet (100C)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blonde woman hiding behind the containers. (100C) <br>Interact with the pictures (50c) <br>Extra C Points (100C) <br>Extra points appear randomly where the floor is green.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3375340?t=1748467746","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375340/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748467746","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375340/a034a567bcb4dbb7318b0dd2d9ba68971e49a25e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748467746","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375340/a034a567bcb4dbb7318b0dd2d9ba68971e49a25e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748467746","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"\r\nThis game contains explicit sexualization and sex scenes,\r\nsexual assault/non-consensual sex, BDSM, abuse,\r\n"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Catchick!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search and find!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The aim of this game is to get 9999C points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you do it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are various actions available to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here is an example:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375340/extras/56a3a49ab3f0b5ef8530b620ce17283b.avif?t=1748467746\" width=80 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are other actions with which you can get C points,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >for example, stand in front of a picture.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375340/extras/e82496a8df41b32b9aa7cc890525e698.avif?t=1748467746\" width=113 height=119 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful! Orange actions can hurt!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375340/extras/187e425973bdc67a9034a728ddbe8d28.avif?t=1748467746\" width=80 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the heart number drops to zero, it's game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to play Catchick? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the beginning of the game you have to entertain the brown-haired woman. Search and find her. When you have entertained her three times she will hide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375340/extras/46b428bcc598b806b1f84d719eda8134.avif?t=1748467746\" width=270 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide and seek: <br>after the &quot;Hide&quot; prompt appears, the goal is to find her. She is hiding somewhere near the colored containers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375340/extras/d5061cd39f105023899cb77dff2e6f33.avif?t=1748467746\" width=165 height=221 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find her, have fun with her three more times until she hides again. You get C points each time. If you have 9999 points, she hides one last time. Depending on how you played, you will then see one of the endings! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375340/extras/df76e71d225697920705c1a9631fd045.avif?t=1748467746\" width=623 height=366 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items can help you collect C points faster. Simply visit the item shop and buy an item. <br>But be careful, orange items hurt the woman. If the heart count drops to zero, the game is over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375340/extras/aa40d792d0ffb2fb1c7bed0e4d00af9e.avif?t=1748467746\" width=600 height=265 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can buy 1 item per hideout round. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here are other ways to get C points: <br>The woman in the shower (100C) <br>The woman in the toilet (100C)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blonde woman hiding behind the containers. (100C) <br>Interact with the pictures (50c) <br>Extra C Points (100C) <br>Extra points appear randomly where the floor is green.</p>","developers":["0-369"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375340/header.jpg?t=1748467746","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3375340/791522/6316eaa8a8eaf51b8255cceddee96ab836322bcb/1750845245/dash_av1.mpd?t=1741508762","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3375340/791522/6316eaa8a8eaf51b8255cceddee96ab836322bcb/1750845245/dash_h264.mpd?t=1741508762","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3375340/791522/6316eaa8a8eaf51b8255cceddee96ab836322bcb/1750845245/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1741508762","id":257076844,"name":"Catchick trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257076844/fa69ca4a9d0c623fe87317cbf9289d5b3d9873f2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741508762"}],"name":"Catchick","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Catchick - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$7.99</span> $3.99 USD","packageid":1194398,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":"-50% ","price_in_cents_w